{"completed": true, "response": "他早就知道自己想说什么，也没有重新考虑自己的心意。他之所以迟迟没有开口，是因为他很清楚，两人现在这样自然又亲近的相处有多珍贵。正因为这份亲近已经存在，说出心里话就不只是表白，也可能改变两人现在的相处方式。他的心意依然强烈，只是没有立刻付诸行动。他的犹豫是因为清楚开口可能带来的后果，而不是怀疑自己或对方，也不是觉得现在的关系不够好。", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8850f261-678a-4409-ab2c-0d92108c9550", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T003206953339Z", "elapsed_seconds": 5.547, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T00:32:12.491519+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ac33397742d0ec3d2a730c3bd0da619ae7c0b51309774edf576f33a5abea067f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T003206953339Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-off